<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίγρᾰφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>copied, in duplicate,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στῆλυι, διαθῆκαι,</span> etc., <i><span class="en">
				D.
				20.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				45.10
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
				Subst., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίγραφον, τό,</span>
			<i>transcript, copy,</i> Decr. ap. <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				32.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1309a11
			</span></i>; esp. of <i>copies</i> of a book, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀττικιανὰ ἀντίγραφα</span>
			<i>copies</i> of an edition issued by Atticus, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀργᾶς</span>
			, al.; <i>certified copy</i> of official document, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CPR</u>
				1.4
			</span></i><span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκόνος ἀ.</span>
			<i>copy</i> of a picture, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Zeux.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φος</span> Jac.).</div>
